{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"Recovery reconstructs configuration from snapshots and later log entries, and each leader term gives replication workers fresh accounting. I also found a separate eligibility question: `VerifyLeader` registers requests with every replication worker, including nonvoters, while its quorum threshold counts voters. I’ll retain both questions in the map and keep the follower-history question as the first candidate.\n"}}
